[sub_resource type="RoseDialogLine" id="RoseDialogLine_v8axg"]
text = "First of all, you must work really hard for our goal of taking control of Junon Planet's market. You'll have to adventure to every single deserted place to find materials and goods. Sometimes you'll have to travel through rough terrain to deliver important products to our customers. You should also know that we are allied with the Righteous Crusaders, especially since they protect us from threats."
