[sub_resource type="RoseDialogLine" id="RoseDialogLine_4uda5"]
text = "There will be 2 Sunrise Crystals near the center of Junon Cartel. If one of those is destroyed, the Sunset Crystal will appear. If our opponents destroy the Sunset Crystal, we lose. Our priority is to protect the Sunset Crystal. If we destroy the enemy's Dusk Crystal, we'll send them to their respawn point in the Cartel. It might be a good idea to have some of us focus on destroying the Dusk Crystal to deter our enemies. If we, the defending side, can withstand the enemy's attack for over 30 minutes, we'll win."
